# characterization baseline: 16-tariff-service-slow-no-client-timeout
# The client sets no curl timeout, so a slow rate service simply blocks the worker inside its open write transaction. Asserts the batch took at least as long as the injected delay (AGENTS.md gotcha 13).
# documents: docs/integration-points.md#net-1--posted-tariff-lookup
#
# Masked values: <CLOCK> clock-derived datetime, <TOKEN> in-flight
# claim token, [PID] worker process id.

